# SDLC AI Native

Before substantial implementation, identify the lifecycle phase from `.sdlc/phases.yaml`.

Use `.sdlc/` for operational SDLC assets. Keep product code in `apps/backend/` and `apps/frontend/`.

For GitHub work, follow `.sdlc/workflows/github-lifecycle.md` and `.sdlc/commands/github.md`. Do not merge PRs, close issues, delete branches, change branch protection, or force push without explicit user approval.

When SDLC config changes, validate with:

```bash
make validate
```
